<title>CROATIA: Croatian February crude, natural gas output fall.</title>
<headline>Croatian February crude, natural gas output fall.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The State Bureau of Statistics issued the following oil and natural gal output details.</p>
<p> CROATIA OIL EXTRACTION     FEBRUARY   JANUARY     FEB '96</p>
<p> Crude petroleum (tonnes)    94,252     97,583     117,614</p>
<p> Natural gas (000 cu m)     139,962    152,225     157,024</p>
<p>PETROLEUM PRODUCTS (tonnes)</p>
<p> Petrol			    78,202     87,301     116,355</p>
<p> Gas oil			   59,312     47,106	56,169</p>
<p> Heating oil		    166,514    196,675     142,794</p>
<p>-- Zagreb Newsroom, 385-1-4557075</p>
